{"v":4,"catch":"平靜的死亡與重生，神秘之夜的GOKURAKU OUJOU。","desc":"《MYSTIC WARRIORS》是KONAMI於1993年發行的動作遊戲。\n在這款遊戲中，玩家與巨型企業「SKULL」的邪惡忍者部隊戰鬥，以營救被俘虜的朋友。\n一定會大受歡迎！ 忍者的世界末日！ 你是唯一能夠阻止這場世界末日的人！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-12-21","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3e9347cfc79e38c6e58944cb59f90140f6363289d8c1f4d0868003b32aaf94a1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/209b4afbaede3fa27ab198774be1b53a693ec0f21e35add1a22fa4e7543483a5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/43c6c38f684988f8070566a4dd22908c7c4be9e31f378b7bc01dc29e2080e4b7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69b5be9c3b9e8843f506362f6f9861be1ff7ff22bbf9f905d34a5316bbdfb7e0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bcfeaf9a9e6d22e4825b109af39b4e701e280908c5448dce35411b51b1ea84c4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/619ba570ced3089765a6726f11aeeee96502ec5eb2f6ac7b7191bc0a5fc2d631.jpg"],"titleId":"01002eb019792000","dlc":[]}